@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@adminToken = GANTI_TOKEN_ADMIN_LOKAL
@studentToken = GANTI_TOKEN_SISWA_LOKAL
@siswaId = 1
@beasiswaId = 1
@rekomendasiId = 1

### Login administrator (gunakan kredensial lokal, jangan commit kredensial nyata)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"USERNAME_ADMIN","password":"PASSWORD_ADMIN"}

### Identitas pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Daftar katalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/beasiswa?page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tambah katalog uji (hanya jalankan pada data pengembangan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/beasiswa
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nama_beasiswa":"Beasiswa Contoh Uji","jenjang":"SMA","kriteria":[{"nama_kriteria":"TKA minimum","tipe_kriteria":"nilai_tka","operator":">=","nilai_kriteria":"80","bobot":1}]}

### Edit katalog: body lengkap, daftar kriteria diganti
PUT {{baseUrl}}/beasiswa/{{beasiswaId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nama_beasiswa":"Beasiswa Contoh Uji","jenjang":"SMA","is_active":true,"kriteria":[{"nama_kriteria":"TKA minimum","tipe_kriteria":"nilai_tka","operator":">=","nilai_kriteria":"85","bobot":1}]}

### Generate draft — memanggil Gemini dan memakai kuota
POST {{baseUrl}}/siswa/{{siswaId}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa/generate
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Daftar seluruh hasil/draft admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa?page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Publikasikan draft setelah ditinjau
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa/{{rekomendasiId}}/review
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status_review":"disetujui","catatan_admin":"Sudah ditinjau."}

### Siswa: hasil sendiri yang terpublikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa/saya?page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Arsipkan katalog (bukan hard delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/beasiswa/{{beasiswaId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Logout token saat ini
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
